function focusedLesson(level,index,phrasesOnly=false){const phrasePractice=phrasesOnly||!vocabularyWords(level).length,groups=lessonGroups(level,phrasePractice);if(phrasePractice){const groupIndex=(state.phraseGroupCursor?.[index]||0)%groups.length;return {groupIndex,groupCount:groups.length,targets:groups[groupIndex],bank:groups[groupIndex]}}let groupIndex=groups.findIndex(g=>g.some(w=>!isWordMastered(w)));if(groupIndex<0)groupIndex=Math.min(groups.length-1,state.focusGroups?.[index]||0);const bank=groups[groupIndex],remaining=bank.filter(w=>!isWordMastered(w));return {groupIndex,groupCount:groups.length,targets:remaining.length?remaining:bank,bank}}
function quizFocusMarkup(s){if(s.isFinal)return '<div class="quiz-focus" id="quiz-focus"><span class="eyebrow">FULL LEVEL FINAL TEST</span><small>All level vocabulary · No hints · Every check must pass</small></div>';return `<div class="quiz-focus" id="quiz-focus"><span class="eyebrow">FOCUS GROUP ${s.focusGroup+1} OF ${s.focusGroupCount}</span><p>${s.focusWords.map(w=>esc(w.zh)).join(' · ')}</p><small>Same ${s.focusWords.length===1?'target':'targets'} for this whole quiz · Mixed skills · New order each quiz</small></div>`}
function levelTestStats(level,index){const completed=(state.quests?.[index]?.attempts||0)+(state.finalExams?.[index]?.attempts||0);const tasks=w=>{if(!isVocabularyWord(w))return 0;const skills=skillsFor(w),other=skillKeys.filter(k=>k!=='writing'&&!skills[k]).length;const writing=!requiresWriting(w)||skills.writing?0:Math.max(1,writingChars(w).filter(c=>!state.wordWriting?.[w.id]?.includes(c)).length);return other+writing};const groupTasks=lessonGroups(level).map(group=>group.reduce((n,w)=>n+tasks(w),0));return {completed,questionsLeft:groupTasks.reduce((n,q)=>n+q,0),testsLeft:groupTasks.reduce((n,q)=>n+Math.ceil(q/10),0)+(vocabularyWords(level).length&&!hasPassedFinal(index)?1:0)}}
function levelProgressMarkup(level,index,compact=false){if(!vocabularyWords(level).length)return '<div class="phrase-practice-note">Optional phrase and conversation practice · No vocabulary mastery required</div>';const p=levelProgress(level),tests=levelTestStats(level,index),labels={meaning:'Meaning',characters:'Characters',writing:'Writing + stroke order',pinyin:'Pinyin',pronunciation:'Pronunciation'};return `<div class="level-progress-summary ${compact?'compact':''}"><div class="level-progress-heading"><strong>${p.percent}% complete</strong><span>${p.learned}/${p.words} words fully learned</span></div><div class="level-progress-bar" role="progressbar" aria-label="Level ${index+1} mastery progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="${p.percent}" aria-valuetext="${p.done} of ${p.total} skill checks complete"><span style="width:${p.percent}%"></span></div><p class="level-progress-caption">${p.done}/${p.total} skill checks · ${p.remaining?p.remaining+' left to complete':(hasPassedFinal(index)?'Final test passed ✓':'Practice complete · Final test required')}</p><div class="level-test-counts"><span><b>${tests.completed}</b> tests finished</span><span><b>${tests.testsLeft?'At least '+tests.testsLeft:'0'}</b> more tests${tests.testsLeft?' needed':' · level complete ✓'}</span></div><p class="level-test-note">${tests.testsLeft?(tests.questionsLeft?'Based on '+tests.questionsLeft+' remaining practice tasks, plus a final test. Extra practice may take more tests.':'Practice is complete. Pass the full final test to finish this level.'):'Practice and the required final test are complete.'}</p>${compact?'':`<details class="level-progress-details"><summary>See skill progress</summary><div>${p.skills.map(skill=>`<div class="skill-progress-row"><span>${labels[skill.key]}</span><div class="skill-progress-track"><span style="width:${skill.total?skill.done/skill.total*100:0}%"></span></div><b>${skill.total?skill.done+'/'+skill.total:'N/A'}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><p>Complete every skill and pass the level final test to reach 100%. Quest stars are tracked separately. Writing is required for individual characters and words, not phrases. The test counter includes finished practice quizzes and full final tests. Mixed reviews do not add to this counter.</p></details>`}</div>`}
function home(){let i=unlocked(),l=levels[i],count=mastered().length,chars=new Set(mastered().map(w=>w.zh).join('').replace(/[^\u4e00-\u9fff]/g,'')).size;$('#view').innerHTML=`<div class="welcome"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LEARNING, EVERY DAY</span><h1>Small steps. Happy progress.</h1><p>A cozy place to grow your Mandarin, one little win at a time.</p></div><span class="date">${new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'long',day:'numeric'})} · 学无止境</span></div><section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT SMALL STEP · LEVEL ${i+1}</span><h2>A little practice,<br>a little closer.</h2><p>${l.title} · ${l.desc}</p>${levelProgressMarkup(l,i,true)}<button class="primary" id="continue">${state.xp?'Continue my quest':'Start my first quest'} <span style="margin-left:20px">→</span></button><button class="secondary avatar-greet-button" id="home-greet">Play with ${esc(avatarName())} ♡</button></div><button id="home-avatar" class="home-avatar" aria-label="Customize ${esc(avatarName())}, your avatar"><div class="home-avatar-portrait">${avatarSVG()}</div><div class="home-avatar-caption"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR STUDY BUDDY</span><h3>${esc(avatarName())}</h3><span class="avatar-edit-link">Change my look ↗</span></div></button></section><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-icon">字</span><div><b>${chars}</b><small>Characters learned</small></div></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-icon">▤</span><div><b>${count}</b><small>Words mastered</small></div></div><div class="stat"><span class="stat-icon">⚑</span><div><b>${levels.filter((l,index)=>isLevelComplete(index)).length} <span style="font-size:12px;color:#7d96ad">/ ${levels.filter(level=>vocabularyWords(level).length).length}</span></b><small>Word levels mastered</small></div></div></div><div class="layout"><section><div class="section-title"><h2>Your quest map</h2><span class="pill">All ${levels.length} lessons open</span></div><div class="lesson-picker"><label for="lesson-jump">Find a lesson</label><select id="lesson-jump"><option value="">Choose a topic…</option>${levels.map((lesson,index)=>`<option value="${index}">${index+1}. ${lesson.title}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="level-choice-note">Each quiz stays with 1–3 words or phrases, mixing skills in a new order. Words build mastery; phrases and sentences are optional lesson practice.</p>${levels.map((l,j)=>`<article id="level-card-${j}" tabindex="-1" class="level ${j===i?'current':''}"><div class="number">${isLevelComplete(j)?'✓':String(j+1).padStart(2,'0')}</div><div><span class="meta">LEVEL ${j+1} · ${isLevelComplete(j)?'COMPLETE':!vocabularyWords(l).length?'PHRASE PRACTICE':practiceReady(l)?'FINAL TEST READY':j===i?'YOUR CURRENT LEVEL':'READY TO EXPLORE'}</span><h3>${l.title}</h3><p class="level-focus-note">Next focus: ${focusedLesson(l,j).targets.map(w=>esc(w.zh)).join(' · ')}</p><p>${l.topic} · ${l.words.length} words & phrases · 10 questions · 1–3 vocabulary targets per quiz</p>${questStars(state.quests?.[j]?.stars||0)}${levelProgressMarkup(l,j)}<button class="path-writing" data-writing="${j}">↻ Mixed practice</button>${l.words.some(w=>!isVocabularyWord(w))?`<button class="path-writing" data-phrases="${j}">💬 Practice phrases</button>`:''}${finalExamCard(l,j)}</div><button data-level="${j}" aria-label="Open level ${j+1}">→</button></article>`).join('')}<p class="footer-note">Read it. Say it. Write it. Make it yours.</p></section><div class="right">${adventureCard()}<section class="panel"><h3>Your daily rhythm</h3><div class="streak-mission"><b>${state.questDates.includes(today())?'🔥 Today’s streak earned':'○ Today’s streak is pending'}</b><p>${state.questDates.includes(today())?'You finished a mini quest today. Nice consistency!':'Finish one full 10-question mini quest to activate your daily streak.'}</p></div><div class="daily-bonus"><b>◉ Daily visit bonus · 5 points</b><p>${state.lastDailyBonus===today()?"✓ Collected today! Come back tomorrow for 5 more points.":"Open Small Steps each day to collect 5 avatar points."}</p></div><div class="goal"><span>Today's goal</span><b>${Math.min(20,state.daily?.date===today()?state.daily.n:0)} / 20 XP</b></div><div class="bar"><div style="width:${Math.min(100,(state.daily?.date===today()?state.daily.n:0)*5)}%"></div></div><p>Just a few minutes can make a difference. Keep showing up.</p><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:20px 0"><h3>Built around you</h3><p>Words build mastery through meaning, recognition, writing, pinyin, and pronunciation. Practice phrases freely in their lessons.</p></section><section class="panel daily"><span class="eyebrow">A CHARACTER TO KNOW</span><div class="hanzi">好</div><div class="meaning">hǎo &nbsp; · &nbsp; good</div><p style="text-align:center">A small word. So many possibilities.</p><button class="secondary" id="daily-word">♫ Hear the pronunciation</button></section></div></div>`;$('#lesson-jump').onchange=e=>{if(e.target.value==='')return;const card=$('#level-card-'+e.target.value);if(card){card.scrollIntoView({behavior:window.matchMedia?.('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)')?.matches?'auto':'smooth',block:'start'});card.focus({preventScroll:true})}};$('#home-greet').onclick=()=>openAvatarPlay();$('#home-avatar').onclick=()=>{tab='avatar';render()};$('#continue').onclick=()=>start(i);$('#daily-word').onclick=()=>speak('好');document.querySelectorAll('[data-level]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>start(+b.dataset.level));document.querySelectorAll('[data-writing]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>start(+b.dataset.writing,true));bindFinalExamButtons();document.querySelectorAll('[data-phrases]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>start(+b.dataset.phrases,true,true))}
function questStars(n){return `<span class="quest-stars" aria-label="${n} of 3 stars">${[1,2,3].map(i=>`<span class="${i<=n?'star-earned':''}" aria-hidden="true">★</span>`).join('')}</span>`}
function questHUD(s){return `<div class="quest-score-row"><b>✦ ${s.score||0} score</b><span>🔥 ${s.combo||0} combo</span><small>Best ${s.bestCombo||0}</small></div><div class="quest-track" aria-label="Quest question progress">${s.queue.map((_,i)=>{const result=s.results?.[i];return `<span class="quest-node ${result|| (i===s.index?'current':'')}" aria-label="Question ${i+1}: ${result|| (i===s.index?'current':'upcoming')}">${result==='correct'?'✓':result==='wrong'?'↺':result==='hinted'?'♡':result==='skipped'?'·':i+1}</span>`}).join('')}</div>`}
function recordQuestAnswer(good){const s=session;if(s.results[s.index])return;s.results[s.index]=good?'correct':s.hinted?'hinted':'wrong';s.lastPoints=0;if(good){s.combo++;s.bestCombo=Math.max(s.bestCombo,s.combo);s.lastPoints=100+25*Math.min(s.combo-1,4);s.score+=s.lastPoints}else s.combo=0;$('#quest-hud').innerHTML=questHUD(s)}
function settleQuest(s){if(s.questResult)return s.questResult;const finished=s.index>=s.queue.length&&s.results.length===s.queue.length&&s.queue.every((_,i)=>['correct','wrong','hinted','skipped'].includes(s.results[i]));const stars=s.isFinal?(s.correct===s.queue.length?3:0):s.correct===10?3:s.correct>=8?2:s.correct>=5?1:0;const result={finished,stars,bonus:0};if(!finished)return result;s.questResult=result;recordMiniQuestCompletion(s);if(s.review||s.isFinal)return result;state.quests=state.quests||{};const previous=state.quests[s.i]||{stars:0,score:0,bestCombo:0,attempts:0};result.bonus=Math.max(0,stars-previous.stars)*5;state.points+=result.bonus;state.quests[s.i]={stars:Math.max(previous.stars,stars),score:Math.max(previous.score,s.score),bestCombo:Math.max(previous.bestCombo,s.bestCombo),attempts:previous.attempts+1};save();return result}
function adventureCard(){const quests=Object.values(state.quests||{}),stars=quests.reduce((n,q)=>n+q.stars,0),attempts=quests.reduce((n,q)=>n+q.attempts,0)+Object.values(state.finalExams||{}).reduce((n,q)=>n+(q.attempts||0),0),combo=Math.max(0,...quests.map(q=>q.bestCombo));return `<section class="panel adventure-card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR LITTLE ADVENTURE</span><h3>Collect moments of “I did it!”</h3><div class="adventure-totals"><span>⭐ <b>${stars}/${levels.length*3}</b> stars</span><span>⚑ <b>${attempts}</b> tests finished</span></div><div class="quest-badges"><span class="${attempts?'badge-earned':''}" title="Finish your first 10-question quest">🌱 First adventure ${attempts?'✓':''}</span><span class="${combo>=3?'badge-earned':''}" title="Answer three questions correctly in a row">🔥 Combo explorer ${combo>=3?'✓':''}</span><span class="${quests.some(q=>q.stars===3)?'badge-earned':''}" title="Answer all 10 questions correctly without hints">🌟 Perfect quest ${quests.some(q=>q.stars===3)?'✓':''}</span></div><p>5 correct = 1 star · 8 = 2 · 10 = 3. Each new best star earns 5 avatar points.</p></section>`}
function shuffled(values){const copy=[...values];for(let i=copy.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[copy[i],copy[j]]=[copy[j],copy[i]]}return copy}
function buildQuizPlan(targets){const buckets=Object.fromEntries(skillKeys.map(key=>[key,[]]));for(const word of targets)for(const mode of ['pinyin','pronunciation',...(requiresWriting(word)?['writing']:[])])buckets[mode].push({word,mode});let length=Object.values(buckets).reduce((n,tasks)=>n+tasks.length,0);const eligibleModes=skillKeys.filter(mode=>targets.some(w=>practiceModes(w).includes(mode)));while(length<10){const minimum=Math.min(...eligibleModes.map(key=>buckets[key].length)),mode=shuffled(eligibleModes.filter(key=>buckets[key].length===minimum))[0];const ranked=shuffled(targets.filter(w=>practiceModes(w).includes(mode))).sort((a,b)=>Number(!!skillsFor(a)[mode])-Number(!!skillsFor(b)[mode])||buckets[mode].filter(x=>x.word.id===a.id).length-buckets[mode].filter(x=>x.word.id===b.id).length);buckets[mode].push({word:ranked[0],mode});length++}const blocks=[];for(const mode of skillKeys){const tasks=shuffled(buckets[mode]);for(let i=0;i<tasks.length;i+=2)blocks.push(tasks.slice(i,i+2))}return shuffled(blocks).flat()}
function start(i,review=false,phrasesOnly=false){if(!Number.isInteger(i)||!levels[i])return;if(phrasesOnly&&!levels[i].words.some(w=>!isVocabularyWord(w)))return;phrasesOnly=phrasesOnly||!vocabularyWords(levels[i]).length;if(phrasesOnly)review=true;state.selectedLevel=i;stopWritingCheck();stopLessonRecognition();const focus=focusedLesson(levels[i],i,phrasesOnly),plan=buildQuizPlan(focus.targets);state.focusGroups=state.focusGroups||{};state.focusGroups[i]=focus.groupIndex;save();render();session={i,review,phrasesOnly,writingOnly:false,focusWords:focus.targets,choiceWords:focus.bank,focusGroup:focus.groupIndex,focusGroupCount:focus.groupCount,queue:plan.map(task=>task.word),questionModes:plan.map(task=>task.mode),index:0,correct:0,answered:false,score:0,combo:0,bestCombo:0,results:[],lastPoints:0};$('#lesson').showModal();question()}
function question(){stopWritingCheck();stopLessonRecognition();const s=session,w=s.queue[s.index];if(!w)return finish();s.answered=false;s.hinted=false;s.speechVerified=false;s.writingVerified=false;s.mode=s.questionModes[s.index];if(s.mode==='writing'){renderWritingQuestion(w);return}const speaking=s.mode==='pronunciation',py=s.mode==='pinyin',reading=s.mode==='meaning';let options;if(py){const variants=new Set([w.py]);const toneGroups=['āáǎàa','ēéěèe','īíǐìi','ōóǒòo','ūúǔùu','ǖǘǚǜü'];for(let shift=1;shift<5;shift++){let changed=false;const variant=[...w.py].map(c=>{const g=toneGroups.find(t=>t.includes(c.toLowerCase()));if(!g)return c;changed=true;return g[(g.indexOf(c.toLowerCase())+shift)%5]}).join('');if(changed)variants.add(variant)}for(const other of s.choiceWords){if(variants.size>=4)break;variants.add(other.py)}options=[...variants].slice(0,4).map(value=>({value,correct:value===w.py}))}else options=s.choiceWords.map(x=>({value:reading?x.en:x.zh,correct:x.id===w.id}));options.sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);s.options=options;
const prompt=reading?'What do these characters mean?':py?'Choose the correct pinyin, including the tones.':speaking?'Say this word or phrase in Mandarin.':'Choose the Chinese characters for this meaning.';$('#lesson-content').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-top"><span class="eyebrow">${s.isFinal?'LEVEL FINAL TEST':s.phrasesOnly?'PHRASE PRACTICE':s.review?'REVIEW':levels[s.i].title} · ${s.index+1} / ${s.queue.length}</span><button class="close" aria-label="Close lesson">×</button></div><div class="bar"><div style="width:${s.index/s.queue.length*100}%"></div></div><div id="quest-hud">${questHUD(s)}</div>${quizFocusMarkup(s)}${skillChecklist(w)}<div class="prompt"><p>${prompt}</p><div class="${s.mode==='characters'?'':'hanzi'}" style="${s.mode==='characters'?'font-size:26px':''}">${esc(s.mode==='characters'?w.en:w.zh)}</div>${speaking?'<p>Speak without a pronunciation hint to complete this check.</p>':''}</div>${speaking?`<div class="speaking-check"><button class="primary" id="pronounce">🎙 Start pronunciation check</button><button class="secondary" id="listen-practice" ${s.isFinal?'hidden':''}>♫ Listen & practice (hint)</button><p id="speech-status" role="status"></p><p class="speech-note">This check compares recognized Mandarin words. It does not grade individual tones or guarantee pronunciation accuracy.</p></div>`:`<div class="choices">${options.map((o,i)=>`<button data-answer="${i}">${esc(o.value)}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}<div id="answer-reaction" class="answer-reaction" hidden></div><div class="feedback" role="status"></div><div class="modal-bottom"><button class="secondary" id="hint" ${s.isFinal?'hidden':''}>Show a hint</button><button class="primary" id="next" ${speaking?'':'disabled'}>${speaking?'Practice later →':'Continue →'}</button></div>`;
$('.close').onclick=()=>{stopLessonRecognition();$('#lesson').close();render()};$('#hint').onclick=()=>{if(s.answered||s.isFinal)return;s.hinted=true;$('.feedback').textContent=w.zh+' · '+w.py+' · '+w.en};document.querySelectorAll('[data-answer]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>answer(options[+b.dataset.answer].correct,b));if(speaking){$('#listen-practice').onclick=()=>{if(s.answered||s.isFinal)return;s.hinted=true;speak(w.zh);$('#speech-status').textContent='Listen and practice aloud. This attempt is practice; try independently next time.'};$('#pronounce').onclick=()=>{if(s.answered||lessonRecognition)return;const R=window.SpeechRecognition||window.webkitSpeechRecognition;if(!R){$('#speech-status').textContent='Speech recognition is unavailable in this browser. You can listen and practice, but pronunciation stays pending until you complete a microphone check in a supported browser.';return}if(window.speechSynthesis)window.speechSynthesis.cancel();const r=new R();lessonRecognition=r;r.lang='zh-CN';r.interimResults=false;r.maxAlternatives=3;const active=()=>session===s&&!s.answered&&s.queue[s.index]===w;r.onstart=()=>{if(active())$('#speech-status').textContent='Listening… say the Chinese word or phrase.'};r.onresult=e=>{if(!active())return;const alternatives=Array.from(e.results[0]);const match=alternatives.some(x=>normalize(x.transcript)===normalize(w.zh));s.speechVerified=match;$('#speech-status').textContent='Heard: '+alternatives[0].transcript;answer(match)};r.onerror=e=>{if(active())$('#speech-status').textContent=e.error==='not-allowed'?'Microphone access was denied. Allow the microphone and try again, or practice later.':'Could not complete the microphone check. Try again or practice later. Pronunciation is still pending.'};r.onend=()=>{if(lessonRecognition===r)lessonRecognition=null;if(active()&&$('#speech-status').textContent.startsWith('Listening'))$('#speech-status').textContent='No speech detected. Try again; pronunciation is still pending.'};try{r.start()}catch{lessonRecognition=null;$('#speech-status').textContent='Could not start the microphone check. Please try again.'}}}$('#next').onclick=()=>{stopLessonRecognition();if(!s.answered){s.results[s.index]='skipped';s.combo=0}s.index++;question()}}
const normalize=s=>s.replace(/[\s。？！?！!，,、.]/g,'').trim();function answer(ok,b){const s=session;if(s.answered)return;if(s.mode==='pronunciation'&&ok&&!s.speechVerified)return;if(s.mode==='writing'&&(!requiresWriting(s.queue[s.index])||(ok&&!s.writingVerified)))return;s.answered=true;recordQuestAnswer(ok&&!s.hinted);showAvatarReaction(ok);const w=s.queue[s.index];state.wordSkills=state.wordSkills||{};const skills=isVocabularyWord(w)?(state.wordSkills[w.id]=state.wordSkills[w.id]||{}):{};if(ok&&!s.hinted){s.correct++;if(isVocabularyWord(w)){skills[s.mode]=s.mode==='writing'?writingChars(w).every(c=>state.wordWriting?.[w.id]?.includes(c)):true;state.mastery[w.id]=skillCount(w);}state.daily=state.daily?.date===today()?state.daily:{date:today(),n:0};state.daily.n+=10;reward(10)}else{if(isVocabularyWord(w)){if(!ok)skills[s.mode]=false;state.mastery[w.id]=skillCount(w)}save()}document.querySelectorAll('[data-answer]').forEach(x=>{x.disabled=true;const good=s.options[+x.dataset.answer].correct;if(good&&(!s.isFinal||x===b))x.classList.add('correct');else if(x===b)x.classList.add('wrong')});const checklist=$('.skill-checklist');if(checklist)checklist.innerHTML=skillChecklist(w).replace(/^<div class="skill-checklist">|<\/div>$/g,'');$('.feedback').textContent=(ok?(s.hinted?'Practice done. Try without hints next time; this skill is still pending. ':(s.mode==='writing'?'Writing verified! +10 XP · +':'Skill checked! +10 XP · +')+s.lastPoints+' quest score'+(s.combo>=3?' · '+s.combo+'-answer combo!':'')+'. '):'Keep practicing; this skill is still pending. ')+w.zh+' · '+w.py+' — '+w.en;if(!isVocabularyWord(w))$('.feedback').textContent=(ok?'Phrase practice complete. ':'Keep practicing. ')+w.zh+' · '+w.py+' — '+w.en+' · No mastery requirement.';if(s.isFinal)$('.feedback').textContent=ok?'Check passed.':'This check did not pass. Review it after the final test.';$('#next').disabled=false;$('#next').textContent='Continue →'}
function startStudyBreak(){const s=session;if(!s||!settleQuest(s).finished)return false;if(!s.breakGame){const treats=[{pair:'berry',icon:'🍓',name:'strawberry'},{pair:'cookie',icon:'🍪',name:'cookie'},{pair:'tea',icon:'🧋',name:'bubble tea'}];const cards=treats.flatMap(t=>[{...t},{...t}]);for(let i=cards.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[cards[i],cards[j]]=[cards[j],cards[i]]}s.breakGame={cards,flipped:[],matched:[],moves:0,message:'Tap two cards to find a matching snack pair.'}}renderStudyBreak();return true}
function chooseBreakCard(index){const s=session,g=s?.breakGame;if(!g||!Number.isInteger(index)||!g.cards[index]||g.matched.length===3||g.matched.includes(g.cards[index].pair))return false;if(g.flipped.length===2)g.flipped=[];if(g.flipped.includes(index))return false;g.flipped.push(index);if(g.flipped.length===2){g.moves++;const first=g.cards[g.flipped[0]],second=g.cards[g.flipped[1]];if(first.pair===second.pair){g.matched.push(first.pair);g.message='A sweet match! Find the next pair.';g.flipped=[]}else g.message='Not a match yet. Tap another card to try again.'}else g.message='One card turned over. Choose another!';if(g.matched.length===3){if(!s.breakRewardClaimed&&settleQuest(s).finished){s.breakRewardClaimed=true;state.points+=3;save();updateHeader()}g.message='All three pairs found! Your study-break reward is 3 avatar points.'}renderStudyBreak();return true}
function renderStudyBreak(){const s=session,g=s.breakGame,done=g.matched.length===3;$('#lesson-content').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-top"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE STUDY BREAK</span><button class="close" aria-label="Return to lesson results">×</button></div><div class="break-buddy">${avatarSVG()}<div><h2>Snack match with ${esc(avatarName())}</h2><p>Take a breath. Match 3 pairs for 3 avatar points.</p></div></div><div class="break-progress"><b>${g.matched.length}/3 pairs found</b><span>${g.moves} turns</span></div><div class="break-board" aria-label="Snack matching game">${g.cards.map((card,i)=>{const matched=g.matched.includes(card.pair),visible=matched||g.flipped.includes(i);return `<button class="break-card ${matched?'matched':visible?'flipped':''}" data-break-card="${i}" ${matched||done?'disabled':''} aria-label="Card ${i+1}: ${visible?card.name+(matched?', matched':''):'face down'}" aria-pressed="${visible}">${visible?`<span aria-hidden="true">${card.icon}</span>`:'<span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>'}</button>`}).join('')}</div><p id="break-message" class="break-message" role="status">${g.message}</p>${done?'<div class="quest-treasure">🎁 +3 avatar points · Break complete!</div>':''}<div id="break-reaction" class="answer-reaction" hidden></div><div class="break-actions"><button class="primary" id="break-return">${done?'Back to my lesson →':'Skip break & return'}</button></div>`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-break-card]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>chooseBreakCard(+b.dataset.breakCard));$('.close').onclick=()=>finish();$('#break-return').onclick=()=>finish();if(done)showAvatarReaction(true,'#break-reaction')}
function finish(){if(session.isFinal){finishFinalExam();return}let s=session,quest=settleQuest(s),l=levels[s.i],ready=practiceReady(l);if(s.phrasesOnly&&quest.finished&&!s.phrasePracticeSettled){state.phraseGroupCursor=state.phraseGroupCursor||{};state.phraseGroupCursor[s.i]=(s.focusGroup+1)%s.focusGroupCount;s.phrasePracticeSettled=true;save()}let earned=0;if(!s.review&&isLevelComplete(s.i)&&s.correct===s.queue.length&&!s.rewarded){earned=25;state.points+=25;s.rewarded=true;save()}$('#lesson-content').innerHTML=`<div class="prompt"><span class="eyebrow">${s.review?"PRACTICE QUEST":"QUEST RESULTS"}</span><div class="quest-finish-stars">${questStars(quest.stars)}</div><div class="quest-finish-avatar">${avatarSVG()}</div><h1>${s.phrasesOnly?'A little conversation practice!':isLevelComplete(s.i)?'Level mastered!':ready?'Ready for your final test!':quest.stars===3?'Perfect quest!':quest.stars>0?'A little adventure, a big win!':'Every adventure helps you grow.'}</h1><p>${s.correct} of ${s.queue.length} answered independently.</p><p class="quest-help">Focus group ${s.focusGroup+1}/${s.focusGroupCount}: ${s.focusWords.map(w=>esc(w.zh)).join(' · ')}. ${s.phrasesOnly?'This is optional practice, with no mastery requirement.':s.choiceWords.every(isWordMastered)?'Group mastered! Your next quiz can move forward.':'Your next quiz stays with the unfinished words in this group.'}</p><div class="quest-summary"><span><b>${s.score||0}</b>Quest score</span><span><b>${s.bestCombo||0}</b>Best combo</span></div>${quest.bonus?`<div class="quest-treasure">🎁 New star treasure! +${quest.bonus} avatar points</div>`:""}<p class="quest-help">Stars track this quest. Words require all five skills. Phrases are lesson practice only and have no mastery requirement.</p>${earned?`<div class="points-earned">◉ +${earned} avatar points!</div><p>Spend your points on a new look for your learning journey.</p><button class="secondary" id="customize">Build my avatar →</button>`:''}<p>${s.phrasesOnly?'Keep using these phrases in conversation. This practice has no mastery requirement.':isLevelComplete(s.i)?'You’ve completed this level. Choose any level to keep learning.':ready?'All practice checks are complete. Pass the full final test to finish this level.':`Complete the vocabulary word checks, then pass the word-only final test. Phrases are optional practice. ${vocabularyWords(l).filter(isWordMastered).length} / ${vocabularyWords(l).length} words mastered.`}</p>${levelProgressMarkup(l,s.i,true)}${finalExamCard(l,s.i)}${quest.finished?`<section class="study-break-offer"><h3>Time for a tiny study break?</h3><p>Match three snack pairs with ${esc(avatarName())} and earn 3 avatar points.</p><button class="secondary" id="break-play" ${s.breakRewardClaimed?'disabled':''}>${s.breakRewardClaimed?'✓ Break reward collected':'Play snack match · +3 points'}</button></section>`:''}<button class="primary" id="again">Play another quest →</button> <button class="secondary" id="done">Back to path</button></div>`;if($('#customize'))$('#customize').onclick=()=>{$('#lesson').close();tab='avatar';render()};if($('#break-play'))$('#break-play').onclick=()=>startStudyBreak();$('#again').onclick=()=>start(s.i,s.review,s.phrasesOnly);$('#done').onclick=()=>{$('#lesson').close();render()};bindFinalExamButtons();render()}
function vocab(){let available=words.filter(isVocabularyWord);$('#view').innerHTML=`<span class="eyebrow">YOUR GROWING COLLECTION</span><h1>Words become your world.</h1><p>Your vocabulary collection contains words and individual characters only. Phrases and sentences stay in lessons as practice, without mastery requirements.</p><div class="tabs"><input id="search" placeholder="Search Chinese, pinyin or English" aria-label="Search vocabulary"><button class="primary" id="review">Review focused words →</button></div><div class="word-grid" id="word-list"></div>`;const list=q=>{$('#word-list').innerHTML=available.filter(w=>(w.zh+w.py+w.en).toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())).map(w=>`<article class="word"><button data-say="${w.id}" aria-label="Hear ${esc(w.en)}">♫</button><h2>${w.zh}</h2><p>${w.py}<br>${w.en}</p><small>${requiresWriting(w)?'Word · Writing required':'Phrase · No writing requirement'}</small>${skillChecklist(w)}<small>${isWordMastered(w)?'Fully learned':'Learning · '+skillCount(w)+'/'+requiredSkills(w).length+' checks'}</small></article>`).join('')||'<p>No matching words.</p>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-say]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>speak(words.find(w=>w.id===b.dataset.say).zh))};list('');$('#search').oninput=e=>list(e.target.value);$('#review').onclick=()=>start(unlocked(),true)}
function writingChars(w){return [...new Set(w.zh)].filter(c=>/[\u4e00-\u9fff]/.test(c))}
function renderWritingQuestion(w){if(!requiresWriting(w))return false;const s=session,index=s.index,chars=writingChars(w),completed=state.wordWriting?.[w.id]||[],character=s.isFinal?s.writingTargets[index]:chars.find(c=>!completed.includes(c))||chars[index%chars.length],mountRound=writingRound;let stage='loading',attempt=0,writer=null,data=null,demonstrated=false,tracePassed=false;const active=()=>session===s&&s.index===index&&writingRound===mountRound&&!s.answered;$('#lesson-content').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-top"><span class="eyebrow">${s.isFinal?'FINAL WRITING CHECK':s.writingOnly?'WRITING QUEST':levels[s.i].title} · ${index+1} / ${s.queue.length}</span><button class="close" aria-label="Close lesson">×</button></div><div id="quest-hud">${questHUD(s)}</div>${quizFocusMarkup(s)}${skillChecklist(w)}<div id="writing-word"><p>${s.isFinal?esc(w.en):esc(w.zh)+' · '+esc(w.en)}</p><small>${s.isFinal?'Write character '+(w.zh.indexOf(character)+1)+' from this word, from memory.':completed.length+' / '+chars.length+' characters accurately checked in this word'}</small></div><div class="writing-stage" id="writing-stage">Loading stroke checker…</div><p id="writing-instructions">Watch the correct stroke order, trace along with it, and then write independently. Shape, direction, and order are all checked.</p><div class="canvas-wrap checked-writing-pad"><div id="checked-character" role="group" aria-label="Stroke-order demonstration and tracing guide"></div><canvas id="freehand-writing" width="640" height="640" hidden aria-label="Draw the character anywhere on this pad"></canvas></div><div class="writing-tools"><button class="primary" id="check-writing" hidden>Check my writing</button><button class="secondary" id="undo-writing" hidden>Undo last stroke</button><button class="secondary" id="clear" disabled>Restart this step</button><button class="secondary" id="restart-writing" ${s.isFinal?'hidden':''} disabled>Watch stroke order again</button><button class="primary" id="start-tracing" hidden>Follow the strokes →</button><button class="primary" id="start-memory" hidden>Start memory check →</button></div><div id="stroke-order-steps" class="stroke-order-steps" hidden aria-label="Demonstration stroke sequence"></div><p id="practice-result" role="status">Loading local character data…</p><div id="writing-reference" hidden></div><p class="quest-help">Draw the whole character anywhere on the pad, large or small, then check it. General shape, direction, and stroke order still count. No guide appears during the memory check.</p><div id="answer-reaction" class="answer-reaction" hidden></div><div class="feedback" role="status"></div><div class="modal-bottom"><span class="quest-help">Watch → trace in order → write independently</span><button class="primary" id="next">Practice later →</button></div>`;
function fail(){if(!active())return;stage='error';$('#writing-stage').textContent='Writing accuracy check unavailable';$('#practice-result').textContent='The stroke checker could not load. Retry, or practice later. Writing mastery will stay pending.';$('#restart-writing').disabled=false;$('#restart-writing').hidden=false;$('#restart-writing').textContent='Retry checker';$('#clear').disabled=true;$('#start-tracing').hidden=true;$('#start-memory').hidden=true;}
function finishWritingPhase(phase,valid){if(!valid())return;if(phase==='trace'){tracePassed=true;stage='traced';$('#writing-stage').textContent='✓ Shape and stroke order checked · Ready for memory';$('#practice-result').textContent='Your tracing shape was accepted. Now write it again on a blank pad.';$('#start-memory').hidden=false;$('#clear').disabled=true;$('#check-writing').hidden=true;$('#undo-writing').hidden=true;return}stage='done';state.wordWriting=state.wordWriting||{};const record=state.wordWriting[w.id]=state.wordWriting[w.id]||[];if(!record.includes(character))record.push(character);state.writingPractice=state.writingPractice||{};state.writingPractice[character]=(state.writingPractice[character]||0)+1;s.writingVerified=true;answer(true);$('#writing-stage').textContent='✓ Independent shape and stroke order verified';$('#practice-result').textContent='Accepted! Size and position did not matter. Correct shape, direction, and stroke order counted toward mastery.';$('#clear').disabled=true;$('#restart-writing').disabled=true;$('#start-memory').hidden=true;$('#check-writing').hidden=true;$('#undo-writing').hidden=true;$('#writing-reference').hidden=false;$('#writing-reference').innerHTML=`<span class="eyebrow">ACCURACY CHECK PASSED</span><div class="hanzi">${character}</div>`}
function startFreehand(phase,valid){const canvas=$('#freehand-writing'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');let strokes=[],current=null,pointer=null,busy=false;canvas.hidden=false;$('#check-writing').hidden=false;$('#check-writing').disabled=false;$('#undo-writing').hidden=false;$('#undo-writing').disabled=false;const redraw=()=>{ctx.clearRect(0,0,640,640);ctx.strokeStyle='#3975a4';ctx.lineWidth=8;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineJoin='round';for(const points of [...strokes,...(current?[current]:[])]){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(...points[0]);for(const p of points.slice(1))ctx.lineTo(...p);ctx.stroke()}};const point=e=>{const r=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();return [Math.max(0,Math.min(640,(e.clientX-r.left)*640/r.width)),Math.max(0,Math.min(640,(e.clientY-r.top)*640/r.height))]};redraw();$('#practice-result').textContent='Draw all '+data.strokes.length+' strokes in order. Any position or size is fine.';canvas.onpointerdown=e=>{if(!valid()||busy||current||e.isPrimary===false||(e.button!==undefined&&e.button!==0))return;pointer=e.pointerId;canvas.setPointerCapture(pointer);current=[point(e)]};canvas.onpointermove=e=>{if(!current||pointer!==e.pointerId||!valid())return;current.push(point(e));redraw()};canvas.onpointerup=e=>{if(!current||pointer!==e.pointerId)return;current.push(point(e));strokes.push(current);current=null;pointer=null;redraw();$('#practice-result').textContent=strokes.length+' / '+data.strokes.length+' strokes drawn. Check when the whole character is ready.'};canvas.onpointercancel=()=>{current=null;pointer=null;redraw()};$('#undo-writing').onclick=()=>{if(valid()&&!busy){strokes.pop();redraw();$('#practice-result').textContent='Last stroke removed. Draw it again in order.'}};$('#check-writing').onclick=async()=>{if(!valid()||busy)return;if(current){$('#practice-result').textContent='Finish your current stroke first.';return}busy=true;$('#check-writing').disabled=true;$('#clear').disabled=true;$('#restart-writing').disabled=true;$('#undo-writing').disabled=true;$('#checked-character').style.visibility='hidden';try{const result=await window.WritingCheck.check(writer,data,strokes);if(!valid())return;$('#practice-result').textContent=result.message;if(result.correct){finishWritingPhase(phase,valid);return}await writer.hideCharacter({duration:0});if(valid()&&phase==='trace'){await writer.showOutline({duration:0});$('#checked-character').style.visibility='visible'}}catch{if(valid())$('#practice-result').textContent='Could not complete the writing check. Retry; mastery remains pending.'}finally{busy=false;if(valid()){$('#check-writing').disabled=false;$('#clear').disabled=false;$('#restart-writing').disabled=false;$('#undo-writing').disabled=false}}}}
function begin(phase){if(!active()||!data||(phase==='trace'&&!demonstrated)||(phase==='memory'&&!s.isFinal&&!tracePassed))return;if(phase==='demo'){demonstrated=false;tracePassed=false}if(phase==='trace')tracePassed=false;attempt++;const ownAttempt=attempt;if(writer)writer.cancelQuiz();stage=phase;if(!writer)$('#checked-character').innerHTML='';$('#checked-character').style.visibility=phase==='memory'?'hidden':'visible';$('#freehand-writing').hidden=true;$('#check-writing').hidden=true;$('#undo-writing').hidden=true;$('#writing-word').hidden=phase==='memory'&&!s.isFinal;$('#quiz-focus').hidden=phase==='memory';$('#start-memory').hidden=true;$('#start-tracing').hidden=true;$('#stroke-order-steps').hidden=phase!=='demo';$('#clear').disabled=phase==='demo';$('#restart-writing').disabled=phase==='demo';$('#restart-writing').textContent='Watch stroke order again';$('#restart-writing').hidden=!!s.isFinal;$('#writing-stage').textContent=s.isFinal?'Final check · Draw freely from memory':phase==='trace'?'Step 2 of 3 · Follow the stroke order':phase==='demo'?'Step 1 of 3 · Watch the stroke order':'Step 3 of 3 · Draw freely from memory';$('#writing-instructions').textContent=phase==='demo'?'Watch the numbered strokes and their direction.':phase==='trace'?'Use the guide to learn the general shape. You may draw anywhere and at any size. Check the whole character when ready.':'Write the character anywhere on the blank pad, at any size. Shape, direction, and stroke order are checked.';const target=$('#checked-character'),size=Math.max(180,Math.min(320,target.parentElement.clientWidth));const valid=()=>active()&&attempt===ownAttempt&&stage===phase;try{let prepared=Promise.resolve();if(writer)prepared=Promise.all([writer.hideCharacter({duration:0}),phase!=='memory'?writer.showOutline({duration:0}):writer.hideOutline({duration:0})]);else writer=window.HanziWriter.create(target,character,{width:size,height:size,padding:18,showCharacter:false,showOutline:phase!=='memory',strokeColor:'#3975a4',drawingColor:'#3975a4',outlineColor:'#d4e6f4',highlightColor:'#8dc1e6',drawingWidth:10,drawingFadeDuration:0,strokeAnimationSpeed:0.8,strokeFadeDuration:0,charDataLoader:()=>data});lessonWriter=writer;prepared.then(async()=>{if(!valid())return;if(phase==='demo'){for(let stroke=0;stroke<data.strokes.length;stroke++){if(!valid())return;$('#practice-result').textContent='Watch stroke '+(stroke+1)+' of '+data.strokes.length+'.';$('#stroke-order-steps').innerHTML=data.strokes.map((_,i)=>`<span class="${i<stroke?'stroke-seen':i===stroke?'stroke-active':''}">${i+1}</span>`).join('');await writer.animateStroke(stroke)}if(!valid())return;stage='demonstrated';demonstrated=true;$('#writing-stage').textContent='✓ Stroke order demonstrated · Your turn';$('#practice-result').textContent='Follow the strokes, or watch again. Your drawing size and position can be different.';$('#start-tracing').hidden=false;$('#restart-writing').disabled=false;return}startFreehand(phase,valid)}).catch(fail)}catch{fail()}}
async function load(){if(!active())return;stage='loading';$('#restart-writing').disabled=true;try{if(!window.HanziWriter||!window.WritingCheck)throw new Error('Missing checker');const response=await fetch('character-data/'+encodeURIComponent(character)+'.json');if(!response.ok)throw new Error('Missing stroke data');data=await response.json();if(!Array.isArray(data.strokes)||!data.strokes.length||data.strokes.length!==data.medians?.length)throw new Error('Invalid stroke data');if(active())begin(s.isFinal?'memory':'demo')}catch{fail()}}
$('#clear').onclick=()=>{if(active()&&(stage==='trace'||stage==='memory'))begin(stage)};$('#restart-writing').onclick=()=>{if(!active())return;if(s.isFinal){if(stage==='error')load();return}if(data)begin('demo');else load()};$('#start-tracing').onclick=()=>{if(active()&&stage==='demonstrated')begin('trace')};$('#start-memory').onclick=()=>{if(active()&&stage==='traced')begin('memory')};$('.close').onclick=()=>{stopWritingCheck();$('#lesson').close();render()};$('#next').onclick=()=>{stopWritingCheck();if(!s.answered){s.results[s.index]='skipped';s.combo=0}s.index++;question()};load();}

const scenes=[{name:'Meeting someone',lines:[['你好！','nǐ hǎo','Hello!','你好'],['你叫什么名字？','nǐ jiào shén me míng zi','What is your name?','我叫小明'],['很高兴认识你！','hěn gāo xìng rèn shi nǐ','Nice to meet you!','我也很高兴认识你']]},{name:'At a café',lines:[['你好！你想喝什么？','nǐ hǎo! nǐ xiǎng hē shén me','Hello! What would you like to drink?','我想喝茶'],['好的。你还要什么？','hǎo de. nǐ hái yào shén me','Okay. What else would you like?','请给我一杯水'],['好的，马上来。','hǎo de, mǎ shàng lái','Okay, coming right up.','谢谢']]},{name:'Making plans',lines:[['你周末喜欢做什么？','nǐ zhōu mò xǐ huan zuò shén me','What do you like doing on weekends?','我喜欢看电影'],['为什么？','wèi shén me','Why?','因为很有意思'],['我们明天见吧！','wǒ men míng tiān jiàn ba','Let’s meet tomorrow!','好的，明天见']]}];
function talk(){let scene=0,turn=0;$('#view').innerHTML=`<span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE COURAGE GOES A LONG WAY</span><h1>Let’s have a conversation.</h1><p>Guided role-play for everyday moments. Listen, then type or speak the suggested reply.</p><section class="panel"><select id="scene" aria-label="Conversation scenario">${scenes.map((s,i)=>`<option value="${i}">${s.name}</option>`).join('')}</select><div class="chat" id="chat"></div><p id="suggestion"></p><div class="input-row"><input id="reply" placeholder="Type your Chinese reply…" aria-label="Your Chinese reply"><button class="secondary" id="mic" aria-label="Speak your reply">♩ Speak</button><button class="primary" id="send">Send →</button></div><div id="conversation-reaction" class="answer-reaction" hidden aria-live="polite"></div><p id="chat-status" role="status"></p><button class="secondary" id="restart">Start again</button></section>`;function prompt(){let line=scenes[scene].lines[turn];if(!line){$('#suggestion').textContent='You completed the conversation. Try another scenario!';$('#send').disabled=true;$('#mic').disabled=true;return}let d=document.createElement('div');d.className='bubble';d.innerHTML=`${line[0]}<small>${line[1]} · ${line[2]}</small><button class="secondary">♫ Listen</button>`;d.querySelector('button').onclick=()=>speak(line[0]);$('#chat').append(d);$('#suggestion').textContent='Suggested reply: '+line[3];}function reset(){$('#conversation-reaction').hidden=true;$('#conversation-reaction').innerHTML='';turn=0;$('#chat').innerHTML='';$('#reply').value='';$('#send').disabled=false;$('#mic').disabled=false;$('#chat-status').textContent='';prompt()}$('#scene').onchange=e=>{scene=+e.target.value;reset()};$('#restart').onclick=reset;$('#send').onclick=()=>{let v=$('#reply').value.trim();if(!v)return;let expected=scenes[scene].lines[turn][3];if(normalize(v)!==normalize(expected)){showAvatarReaction(false,'#conversation-reaction');$('#chat-status').textContent='For this guided practice, try: '+expected;return}showAvatarReaction(true,'#conversation-reaction');let d=document.createElement('div');d.className='bubble me';d.textContent=v;$('#chat').append(d);$('#reply').value='';$('#chat-status').textContent='Good work. Your reply matches the practice phrase.';turn++;prompt()};$('#reply').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'&&!$('#send').disabled)$('#send').click()};$('#mic').onclick=()=>{let R=window.SpeechRecognition||window.webkitSpeechRecognition;if(!R){$('#chat-status').textContent='Speech recognition is unavailable here. Type your reply, or practice aloud with the audio.';return}let r=new R();r.lang='zh-CN';r.onstart=()=>$('#chat-status').textContent='Listening…';r.onresult=e=>{$('#reply').value=e.results[0][0].transcript;$('#chat-status').textContent='Check the transcript, then send. Recognition does not assess tones.'};r.onerror=()=>$('#chat-status').textContent='Could not hear you. Check microphone permission or type your reply.';r.onend=()=>{if($('#chat-status').textContent==='Listening…')$('#chat-status').textContent='Try again or type your reply.'};r.start()};reset()}
